    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/e95bb319e2b091396922b17f6a273a3f.poster.avif?t=1728977367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/e95bb319e2b091396922b17f6a273a3f.webm?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/e95bb319e2b091396922b17f6a273a3f.mp4?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>Buzz</h1><p>KOTAKU - <i>&quot;This isn\u2019t a hidden object mobile game. In fact, it\u2019s a damned gorgeous-looking third-person adventure, that looks as though it were set in a 3D Proteus.&quot;</i><br>Prankster101 - <i>&quot;Cynthia certainly defies expectations of what a lone auteur is capable of, and is testament to what can be achieved by someone who doesn\u2019t have outside funding.&quot;</i></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A third-person stealth adventure game focused on the story of the Moonshadow Huntress: Cynthia Stranborg. Take control of the young adept and learn new stealth skills during your journey. Find out what happened in the home village and follow your desired path to rescue the ones you love the most. Travel through Tesana Valley to find a secretly hidden missing piece of artifact to enhance your bow. The Dark Power is coming from the north. You need to destroy the source of this power before it's too late. You are the last one that can reach that destination. At least you need to try, for your loved ones! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/25337384e3e09f23f296da18f4c13c1c.webp?t=1728977367\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/035117e98b8fe726bcd9a258a5f360e3.avif?t=1728977367\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/48f1a63bb93e0c7798855f5381b5bef3.poster.avif?t=1728977367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/48f1a63bb93e0c7798855f5381b5bef3.webm?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/48f1a63bb93e0c7798855f5381b5bef3.mp4?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Travel through a colorful world. Explore and discover secrets of the Tesana lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/d3715add5785d9132a946d2c913835fb.avif?t=1728977367\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/263e9ba1552a53a84c055efcffdf6838.poster.avif?t=1728977367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/263e9ba1552a53a84c055efcffdf6838.webm?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/263e9ba1552a53a84c055efcffdf6838.mp4?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Use the environment to your favor. Shoot your bow to distract enemies or to turn situations to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/01ef91b262094d1488af62238da0f716.avif?t=1728977367\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/f1cdc2a109aa42baf0cd921acddc4bbf.poster.avif?t=1728977367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/f1cdc2a109aa42baf0cd921acddc4bbf.webm?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/f1cdc2a109aa42baf0cd921acddc4bbf.mp4?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Figure out a way to solve the puzzles you encounter on your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/fe05c8c241a54c9e2c656a81557fd469.avif?t=1728977367\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/1f5c81e101222276323f337d230be3f1.poster.avif?t=1728977367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/1f5c81e101222276323f337d230be3f1.webm?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/1f5c81e101222276323f337d230be3f1.mp4?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Collect materials and craft different types of arrows at campfires to deal with Priests of the North. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/b499bf168f47dbf82f5d859fe43f732c.avif?t=1728977367\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/139fb128802033e105ccf562c93eb133.poster.avif?t=1728977367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/139fb128802033e105ccf562c93eb133.webm?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/139fb128802033e105ccf562c93eb133.mp4?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Climb in special spots to reach normally inaccessible places or use ziplines to travel faster from one point to another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/25337384e3e09f23f296da18f4c13c1c.webp?t=1728977367\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/6f9f92a9c67a4f1986c3d92c7f03da4e.avif?t=1728977367\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized and colorful world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully voice acted emotional story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth mechanics, arrows crafting, climbing sequences and light puzzle solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A short story-driven game (to finish in one evening)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several alternative outfits to unlock throughout the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dedicated photo mode with multiple options to modify: pose, camera effects, stickers, face mimics etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/25337384e3e09f23f296da18f4c13c1c.webp?t=1728977367\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A third-person stealth adventure game focused on the story of the Moonshadow Huntress: Cynthia Stranborg. Take control of the young adept and learn new stealth skills during your journey. Find out what happened in the home village and follow your desired path to rescue the ones you love the most. Travel through Tesana Valley to find a secretly hidden missing piece of artifact to enhance your bow. The Dark Power is coming from the north. You need to destroy the source of this power before it's too late. You are the last one that can reach that destination. At least you need to try, for your loved ones! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/25337384e3e09f23f296da18f4c13c1c.webp?t=1728977367\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/035117e98b8fe726bcd9a258a5f360e3.avif?t=1728977367\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/48f1a63bb93e0c7798855f5381b5bef3.poster.avif?t=1728977367\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/48f1a63bb93e0c7798855f5381b5bef3.webm?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/48f1a63bb93e0c7798855f5381b5bef3.mp4?t=1728977367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Travel through a colorful world. Explore and discover secrets of the Tesana lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1685730/extras/d3715add5785d9